{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cropia, you settle in a peaceful countryside where fertile soil, lively wildlife, and a welcoming town await. You\u2019ll build your own farm and ranch while contributing to the growth of the community around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Farm &amp; Harvest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate fertile land with a variety of crops and watch your farm grow. Arrange your fields, expand your farmland, and create a space that reflects your own farming style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/50804ff7989a52aabe6b49ccdbd03931.poster.avif?t=1759900714\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/50804ff7989a52aabe6b49ccdbd03931.webm?t=1759900714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/50804ff7989a52aabe6b49ccdbd03931.mp4?t=1759900714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc11 <strong>Raise &amp; Care</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of animals ranging from chickens to larger livestock, ensuring they are fed and comfortable. In return, they provide valuable products and add life and charm to your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/6634424def275b81fa854c6b6c7e16da.poster.avif?t=1759900714\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/6634424def275b81fa854c6b6c7e16da.webm?t=1759900714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/6634424def275b81fa854c6b6c7e16da.mp4?t=1759900714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Go Fishing</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend time casting your line and experience the calm of fishing as you try to catch different kinds of fish. Each attempt brings the excitement of a new catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/244b7adb0c56e1094584bfd8bddb5399.poster.avif?t=1759900714\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/244b7adb0c56e1094584bfd8bddb5399.webm?t=1759900714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/244b7adb0c56e1094584bfd8bddb5399.mp4?t=1759900714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26cf\ufe0f Mining</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mines to collect resources that are essential for crafting and upgrading your tools and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/be673d5815d61ae2223444dcd97d5bee.poster.avif?t=1759900714\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/be673d5815d61ae2223444dcd97d5bee.webm?t=1759900714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/be673d5815d61ae2223444dcd97d5bee.mp4?t=1759900714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Discover &amp; Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step outside your farm to stroll through forests, walk along the shore, or visit the bustling city. Take your time to enjoy the changing scenery and atmosphere as you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/d3fd41506cbec77530ba9a689973cc75.poster.avif?t=1759900714\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/d3fd41506cbec77530ba9a689973cc75.webm?t=1759900714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/d3fd41506cbec77530ba9a689973cc75.mp4?t=1759900714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Connect with the Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the townsfolk, each with their own unique personalities and needs. Build lasting friendships, sell goods, and become a valued part of the town\u2019s daily life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/6e4e88d2883b7bd53ce83b7850a5af8d.poster.avif?t=1759900714\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/6e4e88d2883b7bd53ce83b7850a5af8d.webm?t=1759900714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/6e4e88d2883b7bd53ce83b7850a5af8d.mp4?t=1759900714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714180?t=1759900714","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/545e97a30